sentences.l:
So they, throughout the town, put to flight, like fawns,
the sweat were cooling off and drank and healed their thirst,
leaning on the fine battlements;

For a young man everything is fitting,
killed in war, torn by sharp bronze,
to lie;

Of these things remember, dear child, and ward off the hostile man
from inside the wall, and do not stand as champion against him,
cruel one;
